WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.310
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:54.070
Alright! Light it flashily!

00:01:55.440 --> 00:02:05.440
Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.070
Zoro!

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:27.510
Stabbing him from behind
is unfair,

00:02:27.510 --> 00:02:28.840
Big Nose!

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:48.430
Hey, Zoro.
You're hurt, you know...

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:51.030
Just shut up
and stay in there!

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:53.370
I'm gonna do things
my way!

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:01.140
<i>Who is this guy?!</i>

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:06.710
Luffy... Who's she?

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:09.050
Oh, she's our navigator!

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:14.220
<i>Get serious!
Who are you guys?!</i>

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:15.880
Move...

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:18.690
You're in the way!

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:37.110
"Desperate Situation!
Beast Tamer Mohji vs. Luffy!"

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:50.520
Why would you go that far?

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:52.520
You're a pirate!

00:03:56.260 --> 00:04:00.130
Those three think they can mock me!
Screw that!

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:05.110
Looks like I can consider this
a declaration of war against me!

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:07.340
Mohji! There you are!

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:14.710
<i>Would you mind if
I take Roronoa Zoro's head?</i>

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:17.420
Be my guest!

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:52.590
What's with this dog?

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:53.920
Dog!

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:10.970
Hey, Zoro!
It's not moving at all!

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:14.980
Hell if I care!
It can do whatever it wants!

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:16.970
I wonder if it's dead?!

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:26.220
Oww! Oww! Oww!

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:30.720
Oww! What're you doing,
stupid dog?!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:33.890
Do you know the situation
we're in right now?!

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:38.900
Damn dog!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.890
Not enough blood...

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:48.240
Heya, Navigator!

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:52.080
I guess you can have this,
since you did save me!

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.820
Oh! The key to the cage!

00:05:55.820 --> 00:05:58.620
You went and got it for me?!

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:00.520
Don't get the wrong idea!

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:03.690
I just didn't want
to wind up owing you!

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:06.290
I'm saved!

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.440
Stupid dog! Stupid dog!

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:25.250
That's not food!
Gimme that key back!

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:28.620
Give it back! Give it back!

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:31.250
Stop that!

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:34.590
Quit bullying Chouchou,
you young'uns!

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:37.520
Chouchou?

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:39.230
Who're you, old man?

00:06:39.230 --> 00:06:44.500
<i>I'm this town's mayor!
Who are you?!</i>

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:45.500
Huh?

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:48.870
My, what a terrible injury!

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:52.310
I take it Buggy went
after you folks, too?

00:06:52.310 --> 00:06:54.830
We need to get you to a doctor!

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:03.480
How's Zoro?!

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.850
He needs to see a doctor,

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:09.190
but he said he'd sleep
it off and went to bed.

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:23.700
So this dog's name is Chouchou?

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:26.940
What's it just sitting here for?

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:28.780
It's guarding the shop.

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:31.150
--Guarding?
--Yes...

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:35.380
Oh! This is a pet food shop!

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:41.550
Yes. This shop's owner
is a good friend of mine...

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:46.950
There you go.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:54.870
So I'm here to feed
his dog in his place.

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:56.870
--In his place?
--Yes.

00:07:56.870 --> 00:08:02.280
He died three months ago,
from an illness.

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:06.680
Don't tell me he's been waiting for
his master to return all this time?

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:11.650
That's what everyone says...

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:20.630
...but I don't think that's it.

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:22.630
Chouchou is a smart dog.

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:26.620
He's probably long known that
his master is dead.

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:34.070
<i>Then why is he guarding the shop?</i>

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:38.410
I think it's because this shop
is a treasure in Chouchou's eyes.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:41.180
I think he continues to protect it

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:44.280
because it's a memento
of his dog-loving master.

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:46.750
I've tried to make him evacuate
on many occasions,

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:51.090
but he won't take as much
as a step away from here.

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:16.780
What's that war cry?!

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:20.890
It's him!
Beast Tamer Mohji!

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:22.860
What do you mean by
"Beast Tamer"?!

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:24.520
W-wait! Hold on!

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:31.470
C'mon, something's here!

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:33.460
Give me the key back!

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:40.270
Oh, I see your friends
have deserted you.

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:42.840
Just after you managed
to escape, too...

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:44.880
Who're you?

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:50.380
I am Beast Tamer Mohji,
a member of the Buggy Pirates.

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:53.790
That sure is a weird animal
suit you got on!

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:58.960
How rude!
This is my hair!

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:00.430
That's even weirder!

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:04.430
Do you think you can rest easy
because you're inside that cage?

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:06.370
You must not know
my terrifying skill!

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:08.200
There is no animal
in this world...

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:12.570
...that Beast Tamer Mohji can't tame!

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:13.910
Shake!

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:21.450
You're nothing but
a nameless sneak thief.

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:23.350
I have no interest
in taking your life.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:25.550
Tell me where
Roronoa Zoro is!

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:27.120
No!

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:29.110
Sic him, Richie!

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:34.520
Yes! The cage is open!

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:41.800
An instant death.

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:43.340
Good Richie.

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:45.040
Now let's find Zoro,

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:47.880
so I can defeat him
and increase my name!

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:49.880
What is it?

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:51.880
Ah, a pet food store.

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:54.210
Alright, make your meal quick!

00:10:55.950 --> 00:11:02.120
Huh? Don't tell me this is this
pathetic little shop's guard dog?

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:10.160
Whew, what a shock!

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:12.660
But now I'm out of that cage!

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:18.110
Alright! Now it's time
to beat all of them up...

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:21.740
...and have Nami
the thief be our navigator!

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:23.280
How are you alive?!

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.050
You're alive!

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:26.550
Is it wrong to be alive?

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:30.880
Being just fine after flying
through houses isn't normal!

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:32.450
It's not?

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:35.720
What is your purpose for
coming to this town?

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:37.860
Why are you involved
with those pirates?

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:39.930
I just decided our purpose!

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:43.360
To get a Grand Line map
and a navigator!

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:48.470
I think that guy in the animal
suit said he was looking for Zoro!

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:49.800
I'll go check on him!

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:06.490
Chouchou. This shop belongs
to the two of us!

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:13.860
This bag is too big
for you, Chouchou!

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:31.680
You don't want
to get hurt, Chouchou!

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:33.670
Just leave it to me!

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:40.090
Bad Chouchou! I told you
not to eat the merchandise!

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:41.580
Now let's chow down!

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:55.360
Oh? You still come at us...

00:12:57.040 --> 00:13:00.040
Chouchou. I'm getting
up in age now.

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:02.510
I gotta check into
the hospital.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:05.280
<i>But I will get better!</i>

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:09.050
Guard the shop well
until I come back!

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:11.040
Hold down the fort!

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:56.820
That tickles, Chouchou!

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:06.640
<i>I think it's because this shop
is a treasure in Chouchou's eyes.</i>

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:09.040
<i>I think he continues
to protect it...</i>

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:12.480
<i>...because it's a memento
of his dog-loving master.</i>

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:39.830
Damn it!
That dog even bit me!

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:50.580
Wait! I just killed you!

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:55.560
I won't die that easily!

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:58.220
Crunch his head
for sure this time!

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:05.270
I won't lose to some lion!

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:06.930
Gum-Gum...

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:12.070
...Hammer!

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:18.410
Richie!

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:23.610
What are you?!

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:28.990
I ate the Gum-Gum Fruit!

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:32.430
You mean you have
Devil Fruit powers,

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:34.590
just like Captain Buggy?!

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:43.540
A-all right! I peacefully
apologize to you!

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:45.940
You don't need
to apologize now.

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:48.430
'Cause that dog's treasure
is never coming back.

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:55.280
That's why I'm gonna
kick your ass!

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:21.240
Pirates are all the same,
every last one!

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:25.080
They take what people hold dear
without a second thought!

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:27.710
Oh, you're alive, pirate!

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:32.420
I figured the lion
ate you for sure!

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:35.820
As a pirate,
you'll do the same thing!

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:38.960
Maybe I should kill you right here
before you can gather a crew...

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:40.960
...and attack people too!

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:43.400
Come! Stop that, girl!

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:45.330
As if you could ever kill me.

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:46.570
Maybe I'll try and see, then!

00:16:46.570 --> 00:16:49.830
I said stop!
What's with you people?!

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:05.220
This is all I could take back.

00:17:05.220 --> 00:17:08.260
Bastard ate all the rest.

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:14.420
<i>He... fought with that lion.
For that dog's sake...</i>

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:19.930
You fought good!

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:22.270
I didn't see your fight,
but I can tell!

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:45.220
Yeah! Good luck to you, too!

00:17:59.810 --> 00:18:02.740
You were beaten?!

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:06.580
I- I'm very sorry,
Captain Buggy!

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:10.420
Mohji! I can't believe
you'd lose to Zoro!

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:13.220
No, it wasn't Zoro!
It was that Straw Hat!

00:18:13.220 --> 00:18:16.860
What?!
That straw hat kid beat you?!

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:18.960
He's eaten the-

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:21.360
Now I'm pissed!

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:23.630
Prepare all
the Special Buggy Balls we have!

00:18:23.630 --> 00:18:26.960
I'm gonna blow this entire
town to smithereens!

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:30.200
Sorry about earlier!

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:31.200
Huh?

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:33.710
I didn't mean to yell at you...

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:36.870
It's okay!
You've been through a lot!

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:42.520
I don't feel like hearing
about it though.

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:43.720
I'm so pathetic!

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:46.850
Chouchou and this young'un
will fight so hard,

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:52.290
yet why must I, the mayor, sit by
and watch our town be obliterated?!

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:54.190
Calm down, Mayor!

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:58.160
40 years ago, this place
was nothing but barren land.

00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:01.970
We all worked together to clear
the land, make fields,

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:05.370
open stores, and build our town.

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:09.610
This town is a treasure
to me and all the citizens!

00:19:09.610 --> 00:19:13.550
I cannot let them domineer
over it any more!

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:17.540
Fire a Special Buggy Ball!
Blow the town away!

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:32.530
Even my own house...

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:34.230
Zoro's sleeping in there!

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:38.200
The young'un is dead now...

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:40.740
Hey! Zoro! Are you alive?!

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:43.300
That's one hell of a way
to wake a guy up...

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:50.880
Not enough sleep...

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:52.990
How are you still alive?!

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:55.160
Thank goodness!
You're alive!

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:59.090
I refuse to let them
get away with this!

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:00.590
I can stand this no more!

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:06.590
Some random scum has no right to
suddenly destroy our 40 years!

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:11.300
I am this town's mayor!

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:16.570
I will protect this town!

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:20.110
Stop! Stop, Mayor!

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:22.920
There are fights
a man cannot run from!

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:24.420
Isn't that right, young'un?!

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:26.250
That's right, old man!

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:27.820
Don't urge him on!

00:20:27.820 --> 00:20:30.920
What can he possibly do by
going to see them?! It's reckless!

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:33.260
I'm fully aware it's reckless!

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:39.560
I'm coming for you,
Buggy the Clown!

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:42.600
The mayor was crying...

00:20:42.600 --> 00:20:45.040
He was? I didn't see it.

00:20:45.040 --> 00:20:48.370
Looks like the party's
gettin' more exciting!

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:50.610
Sure does!

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:53.480
This is no time to be laughing!

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:56.350
It's okay! I like that old guy!

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:58.180
I absolutely won't let him die!

00:20:58.180 --> 00:21:00.690
In that case...

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:03.320
You're gonna go, too?!
With that wound?!

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:08.800
The injury to my name is much worse
than the injury to my gut!

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:11.800
Our destination
is the Grand Line.

00:21:11.800 --> 00:21:16.570
So we're gonna steal
that map back now!

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:19.840
Join our crew, Nami!

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:22.670
I'll never be a pirate.

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:29.340
How about we team up
for our common goal?

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:34.020
The second shot is ready, sir!

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:35.620
Alright! Fire!

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:38.960
Come out, Buggy the Clown!

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:44.460
I am Mayor Boodle!

00:21:44.460 --> 00:21:48.770
This town is our treasure!
I've come to protect it! Fight me!

00:21:48.770 --> 00:21:53.310
What are you, stupid?!
Treasure is gold, silver, and jewels!

00:21:53.310 --> 00:21:56.580
This town, a treasure?!
Cut the crap!

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:59.070
You'd never understand how I feel-

00:22:00.480 --> 00:22:04.250
I'm soon going to conquer
the Grand Line and flashily obtain...

00:22:04.250 --> 00:22:07.050
...all of the world's riches!

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:08.990
The world's riches are mine!

00:22:08.990 --> 00:22:11.960
No one else in this world
needs treasure but me!

00:22:11.960 --> 00:22:17.300
If this town's that important to you,
shall I destroy you with it?!

00:22:17.300 --> 00:22:20.670
Quit prattling and fight me!

00:22:20.670 --> 00:22:22.400
Don't get cocky now!

00:22:22.400 --> 00:22:27.870
I won't let you destroy this town!
Even if it costs me my life!

00:22:27.870 --> 00:22:29.340
Fire!

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:34.070
The straw hat guy!

00:22:46.030 --> 00:22:49.720
I'm here to kick your ass,
just like I promised!

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:06.070
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:36.930
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:45.420
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:52.490
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.490 --> 00:24:02.490
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
